      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h2 id=\"deploy-app---mtx-page\"><a href=\"#deploy-app---mtx-page\">Deploy App - MTX page</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Deploy App",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Navigate to Home</li>\n<li>Launch MTX</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8dd067ea2b1a36cc.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2002
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - Instructions",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>When MTX page open the first time you will see the quick instructions</li>\n<li>Read trough the instructions</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e544ca877fc47672.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2004
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - General",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>MTX page is where you see your servers active live streams, can add a new live stream and have a link for the documentation</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/85b93cfe62859e25.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2004
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - Watching Stream",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Active live streams are shown in as a list</li>\n<li>You can search for specific Callsing or device type \"gopro, icu, uas..\"</li>\n<li>To watch a stream click the \"Play\" button</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/74c421939cff4b12.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2002
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - Watching Stream Basic",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Stream opens to browser and is automatically played</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/57fae925d2f171e7.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2002
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - Watching Stream Advanced",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>If you need to watch the stream with something else than the browser</li>\n<li>Click on the link, NOT the button</li>\n<li>The advanced menu is now available</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/613aaa7253087dca.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 1999
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - Publish Stream",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>To Publish a stream select \"+ Add\"</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/85b93cfe62859e25.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2004
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - Publish Stream Instructions",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>First you get the Streaming instructions, read trough them.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/bb5c6f58938a17c8.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2006
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX Page - Publish Stream Menu",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Here you will find your credentials and instuctions for different tools</li>\n<li>Preferred method to stream from your android device is Opentak ICU</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0bc49287e346237c.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2004
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You can close this guide.</li>\n</ul>",
