    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>After seeing Deploy App - MTX, continue to <a href=\"/doc/e96c8450-ee15-4607-be9b-d1a479bcc24b\">Publish Stream</a>for more depth on publishing or for more in depth for watching <a href=\"/doc/9c3d844b-ebb7-453c-9d30-7bab0891f66e\">Watch Stream</a></p>"
